tegory":"American (Traditional)","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Wine Bars","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"XnVmNQdmyhdCC90FRY9ZJQ","review_id":"kh3OPWQ-gk8DnOdageYpRg","date":"2018-06-22T18:38:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.938806414604187,"text_excerpt":"At the Ruth's Chris in NOLA they are serving up a pretty standard experience. Its a chain lets not for get that, but it is pretty high end. The menu has something for everyone even if you are not a steak lover. We celebrated a birthday here and our waiter Joe M. is top notch. He was informative, patient and expertly timely. We all ordered off of their four course menu and all happy with our meals. I think everyone got the filet except me, I had the rib eye. The flavors were definitely all there and the portions were plentiful. Dessert came with the meal and it was excellent, a cheesecake and a separate big Italian cheesecake was brought for the birthday celebration and it was the crowd fa..."},{"business_id":"XnVmNQdmyhdCC90FRY9ZJQ","review_id":"25cxbS0ICu-vaE5-8qtUPA","date":"2017-03-15T03:46:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.93190598487854,"text_excerpt":"This was our second time at the downtown location of Ruth's. The food and service here is excellent. Angel was our server , and she was great. We started off with bar b que shrimp appetizers and stuffed mushrooms. They were very good. Also had wedge salad , with excellent bleu cheese dressing, with chunks of bleu cheese and lots of bacon bits. Our filets were cooked as ordered and were delicious. Our sides of steak fries and creamed spinach were fresh and delicious. We have at dined at most of the top steakhouses in New Orleans and this location of Ruth's ranks up there with the best."},{"business_id":"XnVmNQdmyhdCC90FRY9ZJQ","review_id":"HJ-ic4smDwMWiLsK9XWqow","date":"2019-08-11T01:48:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9265465140342712,"text_excerpt":"Ok so Sean Rixner the GM has read my review of our experience at the restaurant on New Years and invited us back with a gift card. My husband and I f Decided to visit again this evening to celebrate our anniversary/birthday. I now understand why people rave about Ruth's Chris. The meal was stellar, the cocktails spot on and the dessert heavenly. I had the 8 oz Filet and my husband had the ribeye. We shared the 3 layer potatoes and the Brussels spouts (either love them or hate them) I also added 3 scallops which were amazing. My steak was melt in your mouth delicious !!!! The 3 layer potatoes were YUMMY !! I had the blueberry mojito -fresh and nothing artificial in it. Very very good. Husb..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"XnVmNQdmyhdCC90FRY9ZJQ","photo_id":"pghT7yxWkGqkHnGPA-fTRg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/pghT7yxWkGqkHnGPA-fTRg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8547308444976807},{"business_id":"XnVmNQdmyhdCC90FRY9ZJQ","photo_id":"1n6uYJ6GxPRS5jx9WQiNzQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1n6uYJ6GxPRS5jx9WQiNzQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.845702588558197},{"business_id":"XnVmNQdmyhdCC90FRY9ZJQ","photo_id":"srUi0oYeSQQp4Mi6QPsM5w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/srUi0oYeSQQp4Mi6QPsM5w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8315775394439697},{"business_id":"XnVmNQdmyhdCC90FRY9ZJQ","photo_id":"Q03uXbe3rIUq6H-2_uguHg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Q03uXbe3rIUq6H-2_uguHg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8222715854644775},{"business_id":"XnVmNQdmyhdCC90FRY9ZJQ","photo_id":"-5EK3LVtcLM0WUax3ZNIlQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-5EK3LVtcLM0WUax3ZNIlQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7815808057785034}]},"notebook_case":null}
